('69d62641-357a-4c10-8d1f-c61024cdc2d3', '520a4cfd-5183-4e11-aecc-bc71a52978b6', 'Priya Singg', 'preeaah@gmail.com', 'Content Creator"', '+971585257166', '"Entrepreneur', NULL, 'attio', NULL, '2026-04-06 05:33:06.50618+00', NULL, NULL, 'United Arab Emirates', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Less than $5k /mo', 'I want The Local Collective to become the go-to digital destination for discovering and shopping UAE-born brands. My goal is to grow an engaged community, onboard high-quality local brands, and position the platform as a trusted space that celebrates local creativity. You can help by developing strategies to increase visibility, drive audience growth, and strengthen brand storytelling across digital channels.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'true', NULL, 'GhostHost™ - Create 15 videos in 1 hour (In the studio)', 'The biggest obstacle is brand awareness. We have a strong concept and clear positioning, but limited visibility and reach are slowing growth. Our challenge is getting in front of the right audience at scale while maintaining the brand’s curated, high-quality feel.', NULL, true, 'd4ffd387-886b-477b-81ab-a4655016e6ab', NULL, '2025-08-12 14:00:01+00'),
('24d70c1d-14a2-4ff7-8543-ce3339a8234c', '520a4cfd-5183-4e11-aecc-bc71a52978b6', 'Emna Bouzouiti', 'emmabozouiti@gmail.com', '+21692804201', NULL, 'Content Creator', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.instagram.com/emnaamiyy?igsh=MTNnazM4bDJ0b2hsZw%3D%3D&utm_source=qr', NULL, NULL, 'Tunisia', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Less than $5k /mo', 'I want to elevate my editing skills and want to know more about editing skills from experts , I want to be more creative', 'Laziness 😂', NULL, 'Highlights™ - Film once, create forever (Lifestyle)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'attio', NULL, NULL, true, '8b2a6ace-2bd1-4eb7-9e60-cc11a26d04c1', '2025-08-08 15:57:27+00', '2026-04-06 05:33:06.50618+00'),
('2bb68d8a-a5ef-478b-b5d5-627ac941db62', '520a4cfd-5183-4e11-aecc-bc71a52978b6', 'WALLACE FERNANDES', 'wallace@syntell.ai', '+971567470135', NULL, 'Entrepreneur', '498e23e2-55d3-4e2d-a9b6-f15f4fa3bf9e', NULL, 'www.instagram.com/wallacexyz', NULL, NULL, 'United Arab Emirates', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Between $5k & $10k /mo', 'I’m an entrepreneur based in Dubai, currently building a innovative saas product in the AI space. My work allows me to connect with startup founders, tech enthusiasts, and industry leaders regularly. I want to create a community-driven Instagram page where I share insights on the latest in tech, startups, and entrepreneurship — offering practical advice, real founder stories, and thought leadership that other entrepreneurs can relate to. I want my content to spark meaningful conversations, build a strong network, and position me as a credible voice in both the startup and tech space. I believe your expertise can help me create engaging, consistent, and high-quality video content that reflects my vision and connects with my audience authentically.', 'I’ve always been a confident speaker in person, but I’ve been hesitant to consistently show my face and share my thoughts on social media. This has held me back from leveraging my personal brand and reaching a wider audience online. I want to break this barrier, get in front of the camera with confidence, and build a content presence that feels natural, engaging, and impactful.', NULL, 'GhostHost™ - Create 15 videos in 1 hour (In the studio)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'attio', NULL, NULL, true, '864b9c04-ec7b-49f2-8eac-30c14097b678', '2025-08-12 07:03:54+00', '2026-04-06 05:33:06.50618+00'),
