('a907b342-7587-4bcc-8ae7-f1f24b085a4f', '520a4cfd-5183-4e11-aecc-bc71a52978b6', 'Abdullah Hamada', 'abdlahamada23@gmail.com', '+966547673359', NULL, 'Content Creator', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.instagram.com/abdla7mada?igsh=MXZqZmwwbmxtNnBsbw%3D%3D&utm_source=qr', NULL, NULL, 'Saudi', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Less than $5k /mo', 'I want to improve my video editing skills to a professional level, so I can produce high-quality content that stands out. I hope to learn new techniques, shortcuts, and creative approaches that will make my workflow faster and my edits more visually appealing. I’m looking for guidance, feedback, and practical exercises to help me apply what I learn in real projects.', 'My biggest obstacle right now is not having enough advanced knowledge and techniques in editing to achieve the results I envision. I also feel that my workflow could be faster and more efficient, but I’m not sure of the best tools and methods to use.', NULL, 'Credits™ - Only Signature Editing', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'attio', NULL, NULL, true, '49cd9f36-dd64-41cd-bdbe-e3abacf99bd2', '2025-08-08 12:27:10+00', '2026-04-06 05:33:06.50618+00'),
