('2a6dd2da-32ce-4589-85e2-bb43cb5d156e', '520a4cfd-5183-4e11-aecc-bc71a52978b6', 'Harsh Raj', 'hraj8989@gmail.com', 'Model / Actor"', '+919135512440', '"Content Creator', NULL, 'attio', NULL, '2026-04-06 05:33:06.50618+00', NULL, NULL, 'India', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Less than $5k /mo', 'My main goal is to increase my followers and overall reach on Instagram. I want to grow a loyal and engaged audience that connects with my content. I’d like your help in optimizing my content strategy, improving my page aesthetics, identifying the best posting times, using the right hashtags, and possibly running targeted promotions or collaborations to boost visibility. I’m also open to performance insights and creative suggestions to keep evolving with the trends.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'true', NULL, 'Highlights™ - Film once, create forever (Lifestyle)', 'The biggest obstacle is limited reach and inconsistent visibility. Despite putting effort into creating valuable and visually appealing content, most of my reels struggle to cross even 10k views. I believe this is due to factors like lack of strategic content planning, improper hashtag usage, timing, and maybe not fully aligning with the current algorithm trends. I need help understanding what type of content my target audience wants, how to structure my reels to increase watch time and shares, and how to position myself better in the explore/feed recommendations.', NULL, true, '287e029f-9bb7-4ee3-b48d-28666e861363', NULL, '2025-08-08 11:21:47+00'),
