('7edad913-06a6-412c-a7c8-a0ab8e1d83c2', '520a4cfd-5183-4e11-aecc-bc71a52978b6', 'Mehdy Mahjoub', 'mehdymahjoub@gmail.com', '+97466705125', NULL, 'Service Provider', NULL, NULL, 'www.instagram.com/drmehdyosteopath', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Between $5k & $10k /mo', '"I want to establish myself as a leading expert in pediatric osteopathy in Qatar, specifically in the treatment of musculoskeletal and orthopedic dysfunctions in children from birth to five years old. My goal is to build a strong and credible online presence—primarily through Instagram—to educate parents, grow trust, and attract patients to the clinic where I currently practice in Qatar. I also want this content to remain relevant for my patients in Canada, where I return to practice for two months every summer.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, true, 'fd07f977-9c90-4880-85c3-b1ac8749eecc', NULL, NULL),
(NULL, '520a4cfd-5183-4e11-aecc-bc71a52978b6', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'true', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-04-04 06:00:00+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-30 02:18:40+00', '2026-04-06 05:33:06.50618+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'attio', NULL, NULL, NULL, true, 'The biggest obstacle is the absence of a professional content strategy and high-quality video production to introduce and position my niche service effectively. Pediatric osteopathy, especially for newborns and young children up to three years old, is still unfamiliar to many parents in Qatar. I’m currently the only practitioner here focused exclusively on this age group, offering early support from birth through key developmental stages. To build awareness, trust, and credibility in a field that’s not widely understood yet, I need strong content that communicates the value of what I do—visually, clearly, and consistently. I’m seeking your help to build this from the ground up, with the right tone, messaging, and visual identity that parents can connect with and trust.', NULL, NULL),
