('469cd3df-7ceb-4cd2-b158-ee82e2afa380', '520a4cfd-5183-4e11-aecc-bc71a52978b6', 'Mohamed Luqman', 'mohamed@sevendawgs.com', '+971509393093', NULL, 'Entrepreneur', '4de5a8c7-f4b6-4de2-8861-02f9e079ffad', NULL, 'www.Instagram.com/mohamedluqman__', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'More than $10k /mo', '"I want to establish myself as a thought leader through podcasts—whether as a guest on top-tier shows or through a dedicated series that aligns with my expertise. My goal is twofold: first, to share hard-earned insights that challenge conventional thinking and provide real value to audiences', 'second, to create a natural bridge between my thought leadership and my businesses, turning engaged listeners into high-value leads.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, true, '16d7fc5f-36c3-4118-a79d-3b1601942ddd', NULL, NULL),
(NULL, '520a4cfd-5183-4e11-aecc-bc71a52978b6', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, true, '"My biggest obstacle isn’t just time—it’s the combination of time and quality. I don’t have the bandwidth to focus on building my own platforms, yet I also refuse to settle for the mediocre options that exist. The market is flooded with generic branding strategies and surface-level content creation, but what I need is something sharper, more refined—something that truly reflects the depth of my experience and the vision I bring.', NULL, NULL),
