('da11e234-8d53-460b-92cf-7c99176e6693', '520a4cfd-5183-4e11-aecc-bc71a52978b6', 'Julia Volet', 'julia@juliavolet.com', '+971561704766', NULL, 'Entrepreneur', NULL, NULL, 'https://instagram.com/Juliavolet', 'https://instagram.com/Juliavolet', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Between $5k & $10k /mo', 'I want to position myself as the go-to expert in luxury scent branding, where my Instagram presence reflects my deep expertise and unique offerings in creating signature fragrances for high-end hotels, restaurants, and corporate spaces. My goal is to create visually stunning and engaging content that educates my audience on the power of scent branding while also showcasing client success stories and my creative process in a way that resonates with my target market. I want to consistently attract luxury brands and decision-makers by building trust and authority through polished, high-quality reels. Your expertise in shooting and editing reels can help me achieve this by turning my vision into captivating, professional content that not only engages but converts viewers into clients.', 'The biggest obstacle I’m facing is creating consistent, high-quality visual content that aligns with my luxury brand positioning. While I have a strong sense of taste and creativity, I need support in translating that into well-produced, polished Instagram reels that showcase my expertise in a compelling way. The technical aspect of shooting and editing reels has been a challenge, and it’s holding me back from scaling my social media presence and reaching the luxury audience I want to connect with.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-10 13:30:00+00', '2024-10-10 13:30:00+00', 'attio', NULL, NULL, true, 'd9f6824a-c10f-4fa7-84ac-e8f4a66d7c39', '2024-12-13 10:16:46+00', '2026-04-06 05:33:06.50618+00'),
